# 泳道定义。一条泳道 = 一个「模型 x 通道」，脚本按 LANE_ORDER 的顺序并发跑。
# Lane definitions. One lane = one "model x channel"; the script runs them concurrently.
#
# 这个文件含密钥：权限设 600，不要提交进任何仓库。
# This file holds API keys: chmod 600, never commit it anywhere.
#
#   cp lanes.env.example ~/.config/pelican-proxy-check/lanes.env
#   chmod 600 ~/.config/pelican-proxy-check/lanes.env
#
# 字段说明 / Fields:
#   PB_<名>_CHANNEL     展示用通道名，如「官方直连」「中转 A」
#                       Display name of the channel, e.g. "Direct" / "Proxy A"
#   PB_<名>_BASE_URL    带不带 /v1 都行，脚本会归一
#                       With or without a trailing /v1 — the script normalises it
#   PB_<名>_API_KEY     密钥。支持 ${VAR} 引用环境变量，例如 PB_X_API_KEY=${OPENAI_API_KEY}，
#                       这样文件里不落明文。${VAR} 读的是**调用脚本那个 shell** 的环境变量，
#                       不是本文件里的行 —— 跑之前先把它 export 出来。
#                       The key. ${VAR} expands from the environment of the shell that runs
#                       the script (not from lines in this file), so export it first.
#   PB_<名>_MODEL       模型 id / model id
#   PB_<名>_BASELINE    true = 这条是该模型的官方直连基线，看板拿它算入 token 差值。
#                       不写时的回退规则：同 model 的泳道里 CHANNEL 名含「直连」或 direct
#                       的那条。同 model 只有一条泳道、或找不到基线时不显示差值。
#                       差值只在**同一个 model** 内部算，跨 model 不算（分词器不同，没意义）。
#                       true = this lane is the trusted direct-to-vendor baseline for its
#                       model; the board computes input-token deltas against it. Fallback
#                       when unset: the lane on the same model whose CHANNEL contains
#                       "direct" / 「直连」. No baseline (or a model with only one lane) means
#                       no delta is shown. Deltas are computed ONLY within the same model —
#                       never across models, since tokenizers differ.
#   PB_<名>_PROTO       openai（默认）或 anthropic / openai (default) or anthropic
#   PB_<名>_TOKEN_CAP   max_tokens（默认）或 max_completion_tokens
#                       max_tokens (default) or max_completion_tokens
#   PB_<名>_EGRESS_PROXY  出站 HTTP 代理（翻墙那种），需要时才填。
#                       注意：这跟被测的「中转站」是两回事，别混。
#                       An outbound HTTP proxy for network egress — only if you need one.
#                       Not the same thing as the API reseller under test.
#   PB_<名>_EXTRA       合并进请求体的 JSON，放各家自己的思考旋钮
#                       JSON merged into the request body — each vendor's thinking knob
#   PB_<名>_EFFORT      思考档位的人读标注，直接显示在看板上
#                       Human-readable effort label, shown on the board
#
# 各家的思考旋钮不一样，别照抄同一个字段（2026-09-13 实测）：
# The thinking knobs are NOT interchangeable across vendors (measured 2026-09-13):
#   OpenAI / DeepSeek   {"reasoning_effort":"high"}
#                       DeepSeek 认这个字段（low 4078 → high 18097 思考 token），但它还会
#                       连带改 prompt_tokens（同一题面 low 105 / high 184）——比 input token
#                       注入时，中转和直连两条泳道的档位必须填成一样的值。
#                       DeepSeek honours it (low 4078 → high 18097 thinking tokens) but the
#                       setting also shifts prompt_tokens (same prompt: low 105 / high 184).
#                       So when comparing input-token injection, both lanes must use the
#                       SAME effort value, or the delta is measuring your own config.
#   Anthropic           {"thinking":{"type":"adaptive"},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}}
#                       effort 有 low/medium/high/xhigh/max 五档，不传等于 high；
#                       thinking.type 只管思不思考，跟 effort 是两个独立参数。
#                       budget_tokens 在 Opus 5 上已移除，传了报 400。
#                       effort takes low/medium/high/xhigh/max; omitting it means high.
#                       thinking.type only switches reasoning on or off — it is a separate
#                       parameter from effort. budget_tokens is gone on Opus 5 (400 if sent).
#   部分国产模型         {"enable_thinking":true,"thinking_budget":16000}
#   Some Chinese models
# 同一档在各家之间不等价（high 档 opus-5 约 1.3k、deepseek 约 18k），跨家别直接比大小。
# The same label is not equivalent across vendors (high: ~1.3k on opus-5, ~18k on deepseek),
# so never compare thinking-token counts across vendors.
#
# 泳道名和行序都从这里推：脚本按 PB_<名>_BASE_URL 出现的先后排，加泳道只改本文件。
# 想自己定顺序就加一行 PB_LANE_ORDER=名1,名2,名3（优先级高于文件顺序）。
# Lane names and row order come from this file: lanes are ordered by the position of each
# PB_<NAME>_BASE_URL. Set PB_LANE_ORDER=name1,name2,name3 to order them yourself.
#
# 要看出中转层做了什么手脚，同一个模型至少得配两条通道（中转 + 官方直连）。
# 官方直连当基线，没有基线就只能看绝对值，看不出被动了什么。
# To see what a proxy did to your request you need the SAME model on at least two lanes:
# the proxy under test plus a trusted direct lane as the baseline. Without a baseline every
# number is just an absolute value.

PB_OPENAI_DIRECT_CHANNEL=官方直连
PB_OPENAI_DIRECT_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
PB_OPENAI_DIRECT_API_KEY=<你的 key / your key>
PB_OPENAI_DIRECT_MODEL=<模型 id / model id>
PB_OPENAI_DIRECT_TOKEN_CAP=max_completion_tokens
PB_OPENAI_DIRECT_BASELINE=true
PB_OPENAI_DIRECT_EXTRA={"reasoning_effort":"high"}
PB_OPENAI_DIRECT_EFFORT=high

PB_OPENAI_RELAY_CHANNEL=中转 A
PB_OPENAI_RELAY_BASE_URL=https://<中转站域名 / reseller domain>/v1
PB_OPENAI_RELAY_API_KEY=<你的 key / your key>
PB_OPENAI_RELAY_MODEL=<跟直连那条填同一个模型 id / same model id as the direct lane>
PB_OPENAI_RELAY_TOKEN_CAP=max_completion_tokens
PB_OPENAI_RELAY_EXTRA={"reasoning_effort":"high"}
PB_OPENAI_RELAY_EFFORT=high

PB_ANTHROPIC_DIRECT_CHANNEL=官方直连
PB_ANTHROPIC_DIRECT_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
PB_ANTHROPIC_DIRECT_API_KEY=<你的 key / your key>
PB_ANTHROPIC_DIRECT_MODEL=<模型 id / model id>
PB_ANTHROPIC_DIRECT_PROTO=anthropic
PB_ANTHROPIC_DIRECT_BASELINE=true
PB_ANTHROPIC_DIRECT_EXTRA={"thinking":{"type":"adaptive"},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}}
PB_ANTHROPIC_DIRECT_EFFORT=high

PB_ANTHROPIC_RELAY_CHANNEL=中转 B
PB_ANTHROPIC_RELAY_BASE_URL=https://<中转站域名 / reseller domain>/v1
PB_ANTHROPIC_RELAY_API_KEY=<你的 key / your key>
PB_ANTHROPIC_RELAY_MODEL=<跟直连那条填同一个模型 id / same model id as the direct lane>
# 这条走的是中转站的 OpenAI 兼容口径（没有 PROTO=anthropic），只能用 reasoning_effort
# 表达档位。中转到底把它翻成 Anthropic 的哪一档，本身就是这条泳道要验的东西：直连填
# high、这条也填 high，两边思考 token 差得离谱就说明翻译丢了档位或者干脆关了思考。
# 如果中转支持原生 /v1/messages，就加 PB_ANTHROPIC_RELAY_PROTO=anthropic，
# 并把 EXTRA 换成跟直连逐字相同的那一段，才是严格同档对比。
# This lane goes through the reseller's OpenAI-compatible surface (no PROTO=anthropic), so
# reasoning_effort is the only way to express effort. How the reseller translates it into
# Anthropic's knobs is exactly what this lane is meant to reveal: set high on both lanes,
# and a wild gap in thinking tokens means the effort was lost or reasoning was switched off.
# If the reseller exposes native /v1/messages, add PB_ANTHROPIC_RELAY_PROTO=anthropic and
# copy the direct lane's EXTRA verbatim — only then is it a strictly matched comparison.
PB_ANTHROPIC_RELAY_EXTRA={"reasoning_effort":"high"}
PB_ANTHROPIC_RELAY_EFFORT=high
